title: A Mission Abroad
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and lw_mission_timer <= 0 and comrades_free >= 4 and time >= 5
on-arrival: {!
Q.lw_mission_timer = 10;
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.lw_mission_played = (Q.lw_mission_played || 0) + 1;
if (!RG.lw) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
RG.lw.card();
RG.lw.candidates(RG.lw.list('free'), 'ab');
Q.lw_where = Q.comintern_member == 1 ? 'Moscow' : 'Vienna';
Q.lw_where2 = RG.pick(Q.time >= 22 ? ['Paris', 'Rome', 'Prague'] : ['Paris', 'Vienna', 'Prague']);
!}
frequency: 90
is-card: true
tags: international

= A Mission Abroad

Requests have piled up on the Zentrale's table. [? if comintern_member = 1 : The Executive wants a German comrade in Moscow for some months, to sit on its commissions and explain Germany to people who think they understand it already. ?][? if comintern_member = 0 : The left socialists of Vienna want a German comrade to help them, and to explain what is happening in Germany. ?] The comrades in [+ lw_where2 +] ask for someone to help them build a party, and a paper, out of the wreckage of the old socialist one.

A mission abroad is an honour and a long absence. A comrade abroad is not in prison, and not in the Zentrale's meetings either. Sometimes that is the point.

- @first: Send [+ lw_ab1_name +] to [+ lw_where +].
- @second: Send [+ lw_ab2_name +] to [+ lw_where2 +].
- @third: Send [+ lw_ab3_name +] to [+ lw_where2 +] for a short visit.
- @easy_discard

@first
subtitle: A comrade of the [+ lw_ab1_fname +]. [? if comintern_member = 1 : Moscow gets to know the German party, and the German party's voice there grows. ?][? if comintern_member = 0 : The left abroad hears our case. ?] The [+ lw_ab1_fname +] lose a leader at home for a while.
view-if: lw_ab1_has = 1
on-arrival: {!
RG.lw.sendAbroad(Q.lw_ab1, RG.lw.rnd(4, 6), Q.lw_where);
if (Q.comintern_member == 1) { RG.ecci('all', 4); Q.independence -= 3; } else { Q.world_revolution += 2; }
var c = RG.comrade(Q.lw_ab1);
RG.lw.lean(c.faction, 0, -3);
Q.unity += 1;
!}

[+ lw_ab1_name +] leaves on the night train for [+ lw_where +], with a briefcase of reports and a list of people to see.

@second
subtitle: A comrade of the [+ lw_ab2_fname +]. The movement abroad gains a German organiser, and the party's quarrels lose a voice.
view-if: lw_ab2_has = 1
on-arrival: {!
RG.lw.sendAbroad(Q.lw_ab2, RG.lw.rnd(3, 5), Q.lw_where2);
Q.world_revolution += 3;
var c = RG.comrade(Q.lw_ab2);
RG.lw.lean(c.faction, 0, -3);
Q.unity += 2;
!}

[+ lw_ab2_name +] goes to [+ lw_where2 +] with a forged passport and a box of German pamphlets to be translated, and writes back every week about comrades who argue even more than ours.

@third
subtitle: A comrade of the [+ lw_ab3_fname +]. A short trip: some goodwill abroad, a short absence at home.
view-if: lw_ab3_has = 1
on-arrival: {!
RG.lw.sendAbroad(Q.lw_ab3, 2, Q.lw_where2);
Q.world_revolution += 1;
Q.unity += 1;
!}

[+ lw_ab3_name +] spends a fortnight in [+ lw_where2 +], speaks at four meetings through an interpreter, and comes home with a cold and some new ideas.
